# A live double-tap on Bread's row (Groceries seed) marks only Bread done; Buy eggs is unaffected (REQ-1)
launch
tap text "Groceries"
expect count id "item.done" 1
expect count text "✓" 1
expect count id "item.open" 2
doubletap text "Bread"
expect count id "item.done" 2
expect count text "✓" 2
expect count id "item.open" 1
expect text "Buy eggs"
